        <li>Post-injury or post-procedure clients under clinical guidance.</li>
        <li>Functional medicine clients addressing gut and inflammatory load.</li>
        <li>Clients with nerve-repair concerns under provider review.</li>
        <li>Clients who want clinician oversight around peptide therapy.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note-box">
        Eligibility for BPC-157 is determined during clinical consultation.
      </p>
